        组织模型与主流程
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 224, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <svg width={700} height={224} viewBox='0 0 700 224'>
        <rect x='270' y='6' width='160' height='40' rx='8' fill='#2563EB' />
        <text x='350' y='31' textAnchor='middle' fill='#FFFFFF' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>Orchestrator 总调度</text>
        <line x1='350' y1='46' x2='350' y2='62' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <line x1='125' y1='62' x2='575' y2='62' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <line x1='125' y1='62' x2='125' y2='80' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <line x1='350' y1='62' x2='350' y2='80' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <line x1='575' y1='62' x2='575' y2='80' stroke='#94A3B8' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <rect x='40' y='80' width='170' height='42' rx='8' fill='#EFF6FF' stroke='#2563EB' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='125' y='106' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E293B' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>产品部门</text>
        <rect x='265' y='80' width='170' height='42' rx='8' fill='#EFF6FF' stroke='#2563EB' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='350' y='106' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E293B' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>专家部门</text>
        <rect x='490' y='80' width='170' height='42' rx='8' fill='#EFF6FF' stroke='#2563EB' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='575' y='106' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E293B' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>研发部门</text>
        <text x='125' y='142' textAnchor='middle' fill='#64748B' fontSize='11.5'>需求分析 · 场景 · UX · 验收标准</text>
        <text x='350' y='142' textAnchor='middle' fill='#64748B' fontSize='11.5'>产品 · 架构 · 安全 · 运维 专家</text>
        <text x='575' y='142' textAnchor='middle' fill='#64748B' fontSize='11.5'>前端 · 后端 · DevOps · 测试 · 代码审查</text>
        <line x1='350' y1='46' x2='350' y2='168' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='1.5' strokeDasharray='5 4' />
        <rect x='40' y='168' width='620' height='38' rx='8' fill='#F0FDFA' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='1.5' strokeDasharray='6 4' />
        <text x='350' y='192' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E293B' fontSize='12.5'>Experience Curator · 复盘 / 记忆 / Skills 提案 —— 治理角色，独立于研发审批</text>
      </svg>
      <Box style={{ width: 436, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>三部门硬规则</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>仅产品 / 研发 / 专家三个正式部门；测试是研发内单一 Agent，不设测试部门</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>Leader 边界</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>入口分派 + 出口验收 + 外部整改 + 异常升级；内部交接与局部返工不逐轮审批</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>确定性路由</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>LoopRouter 是服务端确定性代码，Agent 不能自报 PASS 或指定目标 Leader</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 150 }}>
